# Icon aliases for the "apps" context.
#
# Format:  <existing-icon> <new-name>
#
# <existing-icon> is either one of our own icons, or an icon from the parent
# theme (Mint-L). The script checks our theme first, then the parent.
#
# Examples (remove the # to use them):
#
# Our own icon under a second name:
# TiddlyDesktop.png              org.tiddlywiki.TiddlyDesktop.png
#
# A Mint-L icon for an app that has no icon of its own:
# utilities-terminal.png         some-terminal-app.png
